+
+## Scope
+
+Complete AFK delivery of four tracks on `feat/s40-quad-track-ux-skill-shell-mcp`:
+
+1. ST-4 FocusBand + DL-4 conflicts + skill_install hints  
+2. skill_install LLM tool → user skills root  
